are drawn as 1 merged events, each the stretch of time some of them were running, on tracks of their own","says":{"scenario.open":"Opening the pod: finding its folder, its keys and its saved state.","files.read.file":"Reading one file from the pod's folder.","union.loadTurtle":"Loading text-format facts into memory.","union.select":"Asking the in-memory facts a question that returns rows.","store.query":"Questions put to the pod's fact store, many of them: the time one or more of them was in progress.","scenario.import":"Bringing the whole record into the pod: converting it, checking it, saving it and judging which records are the same.","core-pod.databaseAnswers":"Checking whether the saved database holds the pod as it stands now, so it can answer in place of a rebuild.","archives.open":"Opening the archives that hold some of the pod's files: reading the directory at the end of each, never the files it holds.","core-pod.inputsHash":"Working out a fingerprint of everything a result depends on, to know when it can be reused.","files.hash.sha256":"Fingerprinting a file's content to tell whether it changed.","pod.profilesTied":"Looking up which profiles the person has already said are, or are not, themselves.","core-pod.builtDigests":"Checking that each saved answer file is still the one the saved state was made with.","core-pod.besideDigest":"Fingerprinting the saved state kept beside the pod, to check it is intact when the pod opens.","kept.readBack":"Reading the saved answers back in when the pod opens.","kept.readBack.restore":"Restoring the saved answers into memory. Sits inside kept.readback.","union.drop":"Dropping facts from the pod's in-memory facts.","union.add":"Adding facts to the pod's in-memory facts.","core-pod.matcherSelect":"A question put to the pod's facts as the 'same record' matcher reads them: the matcher's own, and the one that lists the arrivals it has not taken.","core-pod.step.perform":"Doing the work of one import step: taking in the new reco